# NOTE: XTB2 does not support SMD/CPCM in ORCA - using ALPB (the solvation
# model native to the XTB family) instead, as established after the DMF
# XTB2/SMD error (see DMF/XTB2/Monomer_XTB2_SMD.inp for the original error
# message).

! XTB2 Opt ALPB(acetonitrile)

* xyz 0 1
N    0.000000    0.000000    1.160000
C    0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
C    0.000000    0.000000   -1.460000
H    1.028000    0.000000   -1.823000
H   -0.514000    0.890000   -1.823000
H   -0.514000   -0.890000   -1.823000
*
